  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02KM">Lemma <span data-tag="02KM">35.14.4</span>.</a> Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X \ar[rr]_ f \ar[rd]_ p &  &  Y \ar[dl]^ q \\  &  S }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a commutative diagram of morphisms of schemes. Assume that </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$f$ is surjective, and syntomic (resp. smooth, resp. étale), 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$p$ is syntomic (resp. smooth, resp. étale). 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> Then $q$ is syntomic (resp. smooth, resp. étale). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
